# Citation metadata for the PAPER. Deposit this file with the paper.
# It is not the repository's citation file: the repository has none at the time of writing (15 November 2026).
cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you rely on the description or method, cite this paper. If you use the data, cite the dataset listed under references by its concept DOI."
type: article
title: "islam.museum: A Citable Open Knowledge Graph and Digital Museum of Islamic History — Resource Description, Method and Validation State"
abstract: "A data and methods paper describing islam.museum, an Arabic-first digital museum with English and Urdu editions whose primary form is a knowledge graph in a public git repository, archived on Zenodo under the concept DOI 10.5281/zenodo.23692511. Records are AI-written under one author's rules; most are drafts and the corpus is not human-reviewed."
authors:
